Response: I can help — tell me more so I can give specific steps. Quick questions:
- What language/framework/environment (Python, JS/Node, Java, C/C++, Go, Rust, mobile, web, Docker, etc.)?
- What are the symptoms (error messages, wrong output, crash, hang, slow)?
